    "TOOLING": "read only by scripts/",
    "DEAD": "no consumer found. NOTE: config_reachability matches by leaf token, so a same-named key in another section can mark a DEAD key READ_AND_USED (e.g. capital_management.max_risk_per_trade_pct vs ultron_risk_gate's)"
